      "end": 14.9,
      "span_duration": 9.26,
      "speech_duration": 8.040000000000001,
      "text": "No crime in a broken-down car. No crime being Negro, neither. Button it up, Mary. Nobody wants to go to jail behind your mouth. I'll do my best, sugar."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 1,
      "speaker": "1",
      "segment_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "start": 28.16,
      "end": 30.8,
      "span_duration": 2.6400000000000006,
      "speech_duration": 2.6400000000000006,
      "text": "Not a great place for three of y'all to be having car trouble."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 2,
      "speaker": "9",
      "segment_indices": [
        6,
        7,
        8
      ],
      "start": 31.32,
      "end": 34.58,
      "span_duration": 3.259999999999998,
      "speech_duration": 2.6799999999999926,
      "text": "We didn't pick the place, officer. They picked us. You"
    },
    {
      "run_index": 3,
      "speaker": "FACE_2",
      "segment_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "start": 34.58,
      "end": 35.2,
      "span_duration": 0.6200000000000045,
      "speech_duration": 0.6200000000000045,
      "text": "being disrespectful?"
    },
    {
      "run_index": 4,
      "speaker": "FACE_0",
      "segment_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "start": 35.96,
      "end": 36.58,
      "span_duration": 0.6199999999999974,
      "speech_duration": 0.6199999999999974,
      "text": "No, sir."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 5,
      "speaker": "FACE_2",
      "segment_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "start": 37.54,
      "end": 40.32,
      "span_duration": 2.780000000000001,
      "speech_duration": 2.780000000000001,
      "text": "You have identification on you? Yes, sir. Yes, sir."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 6,
      "speaker": "8",
      "segment_indices": [
        12,
        13
      ],
      "start": 42.58,
      "end": 45.7,
      "span_duration": 3.1200000000000045,
      "speech_duration": 2.8200000000000074,
      "text": "We're just on our way to work. We're going to be in the car. At Langley?"
    },
    {
      "run_index": 7,
      "speaker": "6",
      "segment_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "start": 46.86,
      "end": 49.5,
      "span_duration": 2.6400000000000006,
      "speech_duration": 2.5,
      "text": "NASA, sir. We do a great deal of the calculating."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 8,
      "speaker": "FACE_1",
      "segment_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "start": 50.1,
      "end": 51.62,
      "span_duration": 1.519999999999996,
      "speech_duration": 1.519999999999996,
      "text": "Getting our rockets into space."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 9,
      "speaker": "FACE_2",
      "segment_indices": [
        17,
        18
      ],
      "start": 52.14,
      "end": 53.7,
      "span_duration": 1.5600000000000023,
      "speech_duration": 1.3599999999999994,
      "text": "All three of you? Yes, sir."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 10,
      "speaker": "5",
      "segment_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "start": 53.74,
      "end": 54.4,
      "span_duration": 0.6599999999999966,
      "speech_duration": 0.6599999999999966,
      "text": "Yes, officer."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 11,
      "speaker": "0",
      "segment_indices": [
        20,
        21
      ],
      "start": 56.22,
      "end": 58.04,
      "span_duration": 1.8200000000000003,
      "speech_duration": 1.1799999999999997,
      "text": "NASA? That's something."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 12,
      "speaker": "FACE_1",
      "segment_indices": [
        22,
        23
      ],
      "start": 59.36,
      "end": 65.06,
      "span_duration": 5.700000000000003,
      "speech_duration": 5.18,
      "text": "I had no idea they hired. There are quite a few women working in the space program."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 13,
      "speaker": "2",
      "segment_indices": [
        24,
        25
      ],
      "start": 74.38,
      "end": 78.06,
      "span_duration": 3.680000000000007,
      "speech_duration": 2.460000000000008,
      "text": "I'm afraid we're going to have to go to the moon. Damn Russians are watching us right now. Sputniks."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 14,
      "speaker": "FACE_2",
      "segment_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "start": 79.68,
      "end": 81.28,
      "span_duration": 1.5999999999999943,
      "speech_duration": 1.5999999999999943,
      "text": "You girls ever meet those astronauts?"
    },
    {
      "run_index": 15,
      "speaker": "2",
      "segment_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "start": 81.78,
      "end": 82.48,
      "span_duration": 0.7000000000000028,
      "speech_duration": 0.7000000000000028,
      "text": "Mercury 7?"
    },
    {
      "run_index": 16,
      "speaker": "FACE_4",
      "segment_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "start": 83.78,
      "end": 84.18,
      "span_duration": 0.4000000000000057,
      "speech_duration": 0.4000000000000057,
      "text": "Absolutely."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 17,
      "speaker": "FACE_0",
      "segment_indices": [
        29,
        30,
        31,
        32
      ],
      "start": 85.21999999999998,
      "end": 91.02,
      "span_duration": 5.800000000000011,
      "speech_duration": 5.219999999999999,
      "text": "Uh, yes, sir. We work with those gentlemen all the time. Those boys are the best we got. I'm"
    },
    {
      "run_index": 18,
      "speaker": "4",
      "segment_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "start": 91.02,
      "end": 91.36,
      "span_duration": 0.3400000000000034,
      "speech_duration": 0.3400000000000034,
      "text": "sure of that."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 19,
      "speaker": "11",
      "segment_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "start": 91.64,
      "end": 92.04,
      "span_duration": 0.4000000000000057,
      "speech_duration": 0.4000000000000057,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "run_index": 20,
      "speaker": "4",
      "segment_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "start": 92.5,
      "end": 94.56,
      "span_duration": 2.0600000000000023,
      "speech_duration": 2.0600000000000023,
      "text": "We gotta get a man up here for what the commies do."
    },
    {
