        50
      ],
      "start": 121.56,
      "end": 125.82,
      "span_duration": 4.259999999999991,
      "speech_duration": 3.9399999999999977,
      "text": "Well, hell, least I can do is give y'all an escort. I imagine you're... You're running late to work."
